# autotune-found: Auto Tune v2 (issue #190) run to the end: the correction is
# verified with three NEW frames after the 300 ms guard, so the session closes
# with the dial on the corrected frequency.
#
# Same trigger and same TEST-ONLY CW tone injection as `autotune-progress`
# (mocks/mock_cw_tune.c: a tone 35 Hz above the pitch, so the CW correction is
# +35 Hz). scenario_settle runs the session to completion and asserts the dial
# stayed on the correction: a failed verification rolls the dial back to the
# start, so landing on start + 35 is the evidence that the verify phase passed
# with fresh frames - not a fixture that just kept the first write.
#
# The real "tuned" against RF (a stable carrier 35 Hz high/low, CWR reversed,
# CW Decoder AUTO on/off) is the owner's radio: docs/autotune.md. The bank has no
# RF and no DSP.

name autotune-found
screen autotune-found

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode cw
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
